 ],
 "checks": [
  "Craven and Cate vol. III: the IX Engineer Command plan called for two emergency strips on D-Day, two refuelling and rearming strips on Omaha by D+3, four advanced landing grounds on Omaha and one on Utah by D+8, and five on Omaha and three on Utah by D+14; the Utah emergency strip at Hebert was finished at 2115 on D-Day.",
  "Ellis vol. I: by the end of August 23 airfields had been built or repaired for 83 and 84 Groups RAF."
 ],
